  "term": "Depacon",
  "definition": "Depacon is valproate sodium, the sodium salt form of valproic acid, a biological substance with anti-epileptic activity. In the blood it is converted to valproate ion, and it appears to raise brain GABA activity and may also stabilize nerve cell membranes through effects on potassium channels.",
